{"h":3395,"w":2400,"lines":[{"c":1,"x":0.65432099136872468,"y":0.098837209520439839,"t":"Sample Writing answers","w":0.21604937235514321,"h":0.016003780005536927},{"t":"TEST 4, WRITING TASK 2","h":0.025873220149423282,"y":0.14114543641554567,"x":0.088147435262854443,"c":1,"w":0.33616167704264321},{"c":1,"h":0.019006286549203111,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.5 score.","x":0.088408499631403473,"y":0.17804207623656731,"w":0.65033426920572912},{"x":0.086338416916711846,"c":1,"t":"Is it right to tell children they can achieve anything by trying hard?","w":0.52902180989583336,"y":0.20345114174867607,"h":0.021846780226564833},{"y":0.22945645163224027,"h":0.020883106370977678,"t":"In some cultures, children are often told that they can achieve anything if they try hard enough.","c":1,"x":0.086364067673568273,"w":0.75525609334309896},{"t":"Giving this message to them can produce several effects on each child.","x":0.088381954459501103,"y":0.24942334699893087,"c":1,"h":0.021472252440255968,"w":0.55984013875325522},{"t":"In the social point of view, telling this to children is very important because we are motivating the","y":0.27610762450638182,"w":0.76760737101236975,"h":0.020983465709169646,"x":0.086375100698191432,"c":1},{"w":0.76352951049804696,"x":0.088411626953986897,"t":"child not to give up. We are making him to try hard, to make an effort, to read between lines and","y":0.29466364464949057,"h":0.021449227215123323,"c":1},{"y":0.31537102449659282,"w":0.76131688435872391,"h":0.020384789636474832,"c":1,"t":"at the end of that long path achieve their objectives. Telling that they can achieve anything if they","x":0.088477360198840629},{"w":0.75733067830403644,"x":0.08841694126991427,"y":0.33406886437238792,"c":1,"t":"try hard enough, we are saying in other words that things are not so simple or easy but they are","h":0.021139796406416722},{"w":0.47119338989257809,"h":0.01914016489988235,"c":1,"t":"not imposible, is all about working hard and doing our best.","x":0.088477379065070111,"y":0.35453474638870142},{"x":0.088379663981732512,"h":0.021741590735769201,"c":1,"w":0.76360112508138023,"t":"Sometimes this is not helpfull because we not always achieve our dreams or goals but it does not","y":0.37906729128582128},{"x":0.088477365703541103,"y":0.39958775023459892,"h":0.019140164899882239,"w":0.78189300537109374,"c":1,"t":"mean we did not try hard, it was just because another person deserve it more than us. So, although"},{"h":0.018987796051061379,"t":"we try hard, there are other factors playing a role in our path.","x":0.088477367104152341,"w":0.49382715861002602,"y":0.42005813992214325,"c":1},{"x":0.088477377675120386,"h":0.019140164899882239,"y":0.44464075406301995,"w":0.75925923665364581,"t":"In the economic point of view, if our objectives demand a lot of money, we are again in the same","c":1},{"x":0.088477362403767523,"t":"situation, although we work hard, it would be ditficult to achieve it.","h":0.017667844522968101,"c":1,"w":0.52469136555989593,"y":0.46643109528465398},{"h":0.019140164899882128,"t":"To sum up, we are teaching to children how life works, it demands hard work, effort, dedication,","y":0.49116607827909364,"x":0.088477370398615848,"w":0.75102879842122405,"c":1},{"t":"time doing things we don't like, studying and attitude. And at the end, if you have done all these","h":0.021802114794476135,"c":1,"y":0.50961411602182771,"x":0.088411978283567685,"w":0.75529317220052083},{"t":"things but you still did not achieve your goal, you will be happy anyway because you did your best.","y":0.52947852773313775,"w":0.76968098958333342,"x":0.08841105174497936,"h":0.021145556644219465,"c":1},{"h":0.011778563015312105,"x":0.092592594475626844,"y":0.56537102457178412,"w":0.29218106587727866,"c":1,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:"},{"x":0.13580247800738968,"w":0.72016459147135425,"h":0.015988372380376759,"c":1,"t":"This candidate has presented some ideas on both sides of the topic, though there","y":0.59738372077960433},{"w":0.71835484822591156,"c":1,"t":"is room for further development. Ideas are logically organised and there is a clear","h":0.020623520490558711,"x":0.13569478038820412,"y":0.61256848243379713},{"y":0.62968840952055227,"h":0.020121613717051123,"c":1,"x":0.13568607477623337,"w":0.70800771077473956,"t":"progression throughout. Cohesive devices, including reference and substitution,"},{"w":0.68751291910807288,"x":0.13568406318499873,"h":0.019594405930230319,"t":"are generally well managed [this message | In \/ From the social point of view |","y":0.64656199392764369,"c":1},{"y":0.66424418589484069,"t":"telling this to children | the same situation | To sum up]. The range of vocabulary","x":0.13374484949208712,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"w":0.70987655639648439},{"c":1,"t":"is wide enough to show some variety, some less common items and collocations","x":0.13366614617353018,"y":0.68002510836714092,"w":0.71417475382486972,"h":0.019187431874629124},{"x":0.13571211509709266,"w":0.64214650472005208,"h":0.01884502067161542,"c":1,"t":"[motivating | give up | try hard | make an effort | achieve their objectives |","y":0.6970158157492391},{"c":1,"h":0.016038020171040834,"w":0.72839508056640623,"t":"dedication] and there are few spelling errors. There is a mix of simple and complex","y":0.7151162789236607,"x":0.13786007278420395},{"t":"sentence structures, some of which are accurate [we are saying ... that things are","c":1,"x":0.13568209330624276,"y":0.72976092638842704,"w":0.72249425252278643,"h":0.02132110685566424},{"y":0.74679860931533226,"w":0.69569997151692708,"t":"not so... easy but they are not imposible | we are teaching... children how life","h":0.020161787107218276,"c":1,"x":0.13569236953209707},{"y":0.76410570237870512,"x":0.13574653126275288,"w":0.7326280721028644,"c":1,"t":"works | if you have done all these things but you still did not achieve your goal, you","h":0.018095354028528798},{"h":0.016020900088288825,"c":1,"t":"will be happy anyway because you did your best]. Others contain errors [making","x":0.13580246252320849,"w":0.70987655639648439,"y":0.78197674403782758},{"x":0.13574242285904289,"t":"him to try hard \/ making him try hard | is all about working hard \/ it is all about","w":0.68325281778971347,"h":0.017595597796221107,"c":1,"y":0.79766279077507396},{"x":0.13580245969733293,"y":0.81537102453365806,"w":0.72839508056640623,"h":0.016024324441826665,"c":1,"t":"working hard | we not a\/ways achieve \/ we do not always achieve | another person"},{"t":"deserve \/ another person deserved], but the meaning is still clear.","c":1,"x":0.13786006996506092,"w":0.58024693806966143,"y":0.83274440523130766,"h":0.016195524146054185},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.84156378643333407,"y":0.91860465098577604,"c":1,"w":0.034979422887166378,"t":"137"}]}